<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The University adopts the semester system and each academic year is divided into two \(2\) normal semesters, namely Semester I and Semester II, and a short semester at the end of Semester II. The new intake of undergraduate students is normally made during Semester I of an academic year. The minimum duration of the programme is four \(4\) years which is equivalent to 8 semesters.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
